%% Semantic contract: P and H are independent; each group partition has one consumer owner.
%% One loop acquires a slot before pulling; each handler batch returns its own slot.
%% Cancellation and shutdown paths are omitted. The SVG is the layout source.
flowchart LR
    queue["P queue partitions; P may be 1"] -->|Pull a batch| dispatch["One pull consumer + BatchDispatchLoop"]
    dispatch -->|Start one batch| handlers["At most H active Handler batches"]
    handlers -.->|Return slot on completion| slots["Shared execution slots; H = MaxConcurrency"]
    slots -.->|Acquire before pulling| dispatch
